        <mxCell id="rule-attrs" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#0E6655&quot;&gt;= ITSI&lt;/font&gt; _key: String?&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0E6655&quot;&gt;= ITSI&lt;/font&gt; title: String&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0E6655&quot;&gt;= ITSI&lt;/font&gt; description: String?&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0E6655&quot;&gt;= ITSI&lt;/font&gt; priority: Number?&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0E6655&quot;&gt;= ITSI&lt;/font&gt; activation_criteria: Clause&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0E6655&quot;&gt;= ITSI&lt;/font&gt; actions: ActionSet[0..*]&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;ActionSet&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;condition: String&lt;br&gt;items: ActionItem[0..*]&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;ActionItem&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;type: String&lt;br&gt;config: JsonObject&lt;br&gt;execution_criteria: JsonObject" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=16;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;fontColor=#17202A;" vertex="1" parent="rule-class">
