        <mxCell id="mult-grouped-many" value="1..*" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#F2FBF8;align=center;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0E6655;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4115" y="1152" width="42" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

        <!-- Interface dependencies to canonical domain -->
        <mxCell id="rel-envelope-notable" value="payload [1]" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;startArrow=none;endArrow=none;strokeColor=#2874A6;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1B4F72;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="notable-envelope-class" target="notable-class"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rel-page-notable" value="page items [0..1000]" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;startArrow=none;endArrow=none;strokeColor=#2874A6;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1B4F72;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;entryX=0.85;entryY=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="notable-page-class" target="notable-class"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="2190" y="1345"/><mxPoint x="647" y="1345"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rel-detail-episode" value="projects" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;startArrow=none;endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;dashPattern=7 5;strokeColor=#2874A6;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1B4F72;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;entryX=0.2;entryY=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="episode-detail-class" target="episode-class"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="3950" y="1345"/><mxPoint x="5524" y="1345"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rel-delta-episode" value="references compact state" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;startArrow=none;endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;dashPattern=7 5;strokeColor=#C25700;strokeWidth=2.5;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#873600;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="episode-delta-class" target="episode-class"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

        <!-- Policy ownership is stated in the band heading to avoid cross-band lines through interface classes. -->
        <mxCell id="rel-rule-webhook" value="action item may reference" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;startArrow=none;endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;dashPattern=7 5;strokeColor=#148F77;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0E6655;labelBackgroundColor=#FFF8F1;exitX=1;exitY=0.05;entryX=0;entryY=0.05;" edge="1" parent="1" source="rule-class" target="webhook-class"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="4260" y="2580"/><mxPoint x="5400" y="2580"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rel-webhook-exec" value="execution result" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;startArrow=none;endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;dashPattern=7 5;strokeColor=#C25700;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#873600;labelBackgroundColor=#FFF8F1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="webhook-class" target="action-exec-class"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

        <!-- Compatibility summary -->
        <mxCell id="compatibility-summary" value="&lt;b&gt;SPLUNK ITSI (.spl) ↔ OPEN-ITSI COMPATIBILITY SUMMARY&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0E6655&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;= SAME — Notable&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;  Exact extensible field bag and common names. Public HTTP requires stable event_id/numeric _time, keeps tenant in `x-oauth2-tenant-id`, and GET removes adapter-injected fields so items round-trip as domain objects.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2874A6&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;+ OPEN — Raw Alert pre-admission&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;  API, Open ITSI Kafka, inbound webhook, and External Kafka normalize JSON through one tenant connection and immutable revision built from hash-pinned package configuration. The webhook is unauthenticated only for this POC; External Kafka consumes one exact topic, qualifies provider identity and broker coordinates by immutable source generation, and stores only a tenant-allowlisted credential reference. Only Open ITSI Kafka uses `openitsi.alerts.v1`; Data Integrations publishes accepted canonical results to `openitsi.notables.v1` for Core correlation. HTTP polling, Search, Search time, Schedule, and arbitrary SPL are absent.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0E6655&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;= SAME — NEAP + ranking + clauses + rules + action webhook&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;  Exact opaque native documents are retained; these administration surfaces remain cross-tenant today. &lt;font color=&quot;#B03A2E&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Unsafe:&lt;/b&gt; a custom NEAP whose split_by_field omits tenant_id can group equal values across tenants.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0E6655&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;≈ PROJECTED — Episode&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;  Native ITSI has no monolithic stored Episode JSON: system KV + user KV + grouped HEC are joined. Open-ITSI preserves those sources, materializes an effective projection, and tenant-scopes public list/detail/similar reads.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2874A6&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;+ OPEN — HTTP representation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;  Tenant is request context, not a domain member; Standalone derives transport identity/envelope and injects tenant before the selected rules-engine lane without changing `.spl`.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C25700&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Δ OPEN — Kafka&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;  schema/message/scope/digest/provenance remain explicit transport metadata. Egress is an append-only tenant-scoped membership delta, not the API EpisodeDetail.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C25700&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;+ OPEN — ActionExecution&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;  Bounded local execution evidence includes durable `in_progress` claims with required `started_at`; terminal fields are optional until completion. A truncated page labels its total as a lower bound. Native package action queue and action logic remain unchanged." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#7F8C8D;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=20;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#273746;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="3610" width="7180" height="430" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;  Teal = native/SPL-compatible domain • Blue = Open-ITSI interface representation • Orange = Open-ITSI addition or intentional delta • ◆ composition/ownership • ◇ aggregation • solid = association • dashed open arrow = dependency/reference" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F6F7;strokeColor=#7F8C8D;strokeWidth=2;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=14;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;fontColor=#34495E;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="310" y="4080" width="6680" height="80" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sources" value="Source anchors: public-openapi.json • alert_integrations.py + package_content.py + mapping_evaluator.py • connectors/kafka/ + connectors/alert_sources/ • bootstrap-neaps.json • extracted ITSI/SA-ITOA integration configuration + native event-management models" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#566573;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="300" y="4180" width="6700" height="45" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
